{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"4b6dd75807c0d024e1cca4a7e82c4b0d6167b9e867d59b78fab7426abd904913","digest":{"component_or_area":"documentation and CLI reference","key_entities":["README.md","docs/user-guide.md","docs/cli-reference.md","src/rebar/_commands/session_log.py","session-log command","session-log append","session-log start"],"problem_keywords":["documentation","CLI command syntax","session-log","missing subcommand","onboarding defect","invalid example"],"propositions":["README.md documents session-log without its required subcommand, showing an invalid bare form that the CLI rejects.","The CLI session_log command requires a subcommand verb (append or start) as the first positional argument; bare invocation fails with 'unknown session-log action' error.","The documented bare form in README contradicts the correct subcommand forms already shown in docs/user-guide.md.","The corrected documentation migrated from inline README examples to the generated docs/cli-reference.md, linked from README's CLI section.","The P0 defect of users copy-pasting an invalid command from README documentation has been resolved by removing the invalid form and centralizing correct usage in the generated reference."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785822376216019311,"uuid":"4c8831a3-1013-439a-a5c0-ef487dcc8248"}